* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R301/C305
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 15915.5 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R301 VBATT_2S_IN IDEAL_VS 100

C305 IDEAL_VS 0 100n

* AC stimulus
VAC VBATT_2S_IN 0 DC 0 AC 1

.control
ac dec 100 159.2 1.592Meg
meas ac fc_sim when vdb(IDEAL_VS)=-3
meas ac phase_fc find vp(IDEAL_VS) at=fc_sim
echo "fc_sim=$&fc_sim phase_fc=$&phase_fc has_parasitics=0" > docs/references/hat-revb-cost-20261104/spice-work/rc-filter_R301_C305.out
quit
.endc

.end
